{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31363","headline":"赠舍弟 · 杨牢","name":"赠舍弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦云蜀浪两堪愁，尔养晨昏我远游。\n千里客心难寄梦，两行乡泪爲君流。\n早驱风雨知龙圣，饿食鱼鰕觉虎羞。\n袖里镆鋣光似水，丈夫不合等闲休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨牢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}